  {
   "id": "pc0013",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 612.0,
   "width": 650.38,
   "height": 247.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "aC",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1401419284,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1892066745,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1771057311960,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Reads 10,000 RPS avg, peak x3 = 30,000 RPS\n2. Writes 20 RPS = ~1.7M writes/day (reads ~864M/day)\n3. Product ~2 KB: 1M x 2 KB = ~2 GB + indexes ~1 GB\n4. Elasticsearch: ~3 GB primary + 1 replica = ~6 GB\n5. Redis: ~2 GB of data (fits in memory)\n6. Images: 1M x 5 x 200 KB = ~1 TB -> S3 + CDN\n7. JSON egress: 10,000 x 2 KB = 20 MB/s = ~160 Mbit/s\n8. Hit ratio 95%: DB gets 500 RPS (peak 1,500 RPS)\n9. Mean: 0.95 x 0.5 + 0.05 x 10 = ~1 ms\n10. Miss path: Redis 1 ms + PG ~10-15 ms = ~25 ms\n11. Worst case: Redis timeout 50 ms + PG 15 ms = ~73 ms < 80 OK",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. Reads 10,000 RPS avg, peak x3 = 30,000 RPS\n2. Writes 20 RPS = ~1.7M writes/day (reads ~864M/day)\n3. Product ~2 KB: 1M x 2 KB = ~2 GB + indexes ~1 GB\n4. Elasticsearch: ~3 GB primary + 1 replica = ~6 GB\n5. Redis: ~2 GB of data (fits in memory)\n6. Images: 1M x 5 x 200 KB = ~1 TB -> S3 + CDN\n7. JSON egress: 10,000 x 2 KB = 20 MB/s = ~160 Mbit/s\n8. Hit ratio 95%: DB gets 500 RPS (peak 1,500 RPS)\n9. Mean: 0.95 x 0.5 + 0.05 x 10 = ~1 ms\n10. Miss path: Redis 1 ms + PG ~10-15 ms = ~25 ms\n11. Worst case: Redis timeout 50 ms + PG 15 ms = ~73 ms < 80 OK",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
