   "text": "Out of Scope:\n- Cart, checkout, orders, payments\n- Reviews, ratings, likes, comments\n- Recommendations / personalization\n- Stock reservation and warehouse logic\n- Buyer accounts and login\n- Multi-currency pricing, i18n",
