   "updated": 1771057311960,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Search sync",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Search sync",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "pc0022",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 1072.0,
   "width": 650.38,
   "height": 270.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "aL",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 463542575,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1719704082,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1771057311960,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Deep dive: keeping Elasticsearch in sync\nPostgreSQL = source of truth, ES = eventually consistent copy\n1. Write: UPDATE product + INSERT outbox row, ONE transaction\n2. CDC (Debezium) reads outbox -> Kafka topic product-changes\n3. Indexer consumes: upsert / delete doc, id = product_id\n   external version = product.version (old events ignored)\n4. Same event: DEL Redis key + CDN purge by Surrogate-Key\n5. Lag normally ms..seconds, alert if > 30 s\n6. Recovery: reindex into new index, switch alias (no downtime)\n7. ES mapping: title, description = text (analyzed)\n   brand, category = keyword, price = numeric, attrs = nested\n8. Filters in filter context (cached), paging by search_after",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Deep dive: keeping Elasticsearch in sync\nPostgreSQL = source of truth, ES = eventually consistent copy\n1. Write: UPDATE product + INSERT outbox row, ONE transaction\n2. CDC (Debezium) reads outbox -> Kafka topic product-changes\n3. Indexer consumes: upsert / delete doc, id = product_id\n   external version = product.version (old events ignored)\n4. Same event: DEL Redis key + CDN purge by Surrogate-Key\n5. Lag normally ms..seconds, alert if > 30 s\n6. Recovery: reindex into new index, switch alias (no downtime)\n7. ES mapping: title, description = text (analyzed)\n   brand, category = keyword, price = numeric, attrs = nested\n8. Filters in filter context (cached), paging by search_after",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "pc0023",
