   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1771057311960,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Scaling type",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Scaling type",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "pc0025",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 777.7199999999999,
   "y": 1072.0,
   "width": 629.8599999999999,
   "height": 247.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "aO",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 72544006,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2340483,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1771057311960,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Horizontal: stateless Product / Search / Write services\n   behind LB, autoscale by RPS and CPU\n2. Multi-AZ, health checks, rolling releases\n3. PostgreSQL: primary + read replicas (async), auto failover\n   reads never touch the primary\n4. Sharding NOT needed: only ~2 GB.\n   If data grows 100x: hash(product_id) shards\n5. Redis Cluster: shards + replica per shard\n6. Elasticsearch: 3 primary shards + 1 replica each\n7. CDN edge for images and public reads\n8. Hot products (flash sale): L1 cache + request coalescing",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. Horizontal: stateless Product / Search / Write services\n   behind LB, autoscale by RPS and CPU\n2. Multi-AZ, health checks, rolling releases\n3. PostgreSQL: primary + read replicas (async), auto failover\n   reads never touch the primary\n4. Sharding NOT needed: only ~2 GB.\n   If data grows 100x: hash(product_id) shards\n5. Redis Cluster: shards + replica per shard\n6. Elasticsearch: 3 primary shards + 1 replica each\n7. CDN edge for images and public reads\n8. Hot products (flash sale): L1 cache + request coalescing",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
