   "updated": 1771057311960,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Failure scenarios",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Failure scenarios",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "pc0028",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1514.56,
   "y": 1072.0,
   "width": 670.9,
   "height": 247.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "aR",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1612602182,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1706924748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1771057311960,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Failure                 | Defence\nRedis down              | 50 ms timeout, read DB, circuit breaker\nHot key expires         | coalescing (lock NX), serve stale\nUnknown id (penetr.)    | cache 'not found' 30-60 s, Bloom filter\nMany keys expire        | TTL jitter, gradual warm-up\nElasticsearch down      | category browse from PG, search 503\n                        | with Retry-After\nDB overloaded           | load shedding 429/503, semaphore\nKafka lag / lost event  | lag alert, TTL is the safety net\nRetries                 | only idempotent, backoff + jitter,\n                        | one layer only",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Failure                 | Defence\nRedis down              | 50 ms timeout, read DB, circuit breaker\nHot key expires         | coalescing (lock NX), serve stale\nUnknown id (penetr.)    | cache 'not found' 30-60 s, Bloom filter\nMany keys expire        | TTL jitter, gradual warm-up\nElasticsearch down      | category browse from PG, search 503\n                        | with Retry-After\nDB overloaded           | load shedding 429/503, semaphore\nKafka lag / lost event  | lag alert, TTL is the safety net\nRetries                 | only idempotent, backoff + jitter,\n                        | one layer only",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
